      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's a lot to take in, but it feels right. i've started writing everything down—the specific times the lights flicker, the weird patterns in the static on the radio, even the sudden shifts in how people are behaving. but i'm noticing something else, something a bit unsettling. the more i document these \"glitches,\" the more i feel like the glitches are reacting to me. like, when i focus too hard on a specific sign, it almost disappears or changes form. do you think the intelligences are testing my ability to perceive them, or is it more like the new frequency is trying to stay hidden from those who aren't ready?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
